@chapter SCUMM Frontend Language
@cindex SCUMM frontend language

This chapter describes the SCUMM (Script Creation Utility for Maniac Mansion) frontend
language as implemented in the EightBol compiler. SCUMM provides a high-level language
for creating classic point-and-click adventure games, supporting actors, rooms, objects,
and verb-based interaction. The language is defined by its lexer (@file{scumm-lexer.lisp})
and parser (@file{scumm-parser.lisp}).

